  "description": "CrossEarth is the first vision foundation model (VFM) specifically designed for Remote Sensing Domain Generalization (RSDG) semantic segmentation. It achieves strong cross-domain generalization via an Earth-Style Injection pipeline and a Multi-Task Training pipeline, and is evaluated on a comprehensive benchmark of 28 cross-domain settings.",
